1601277661846_5428982906936699612_n.png?_nc_cat=103&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=6hovRs87pnsQ7kNvwFUzZz4&_nc_oc=AdpBssnKeTq2WgzfLeY-Lqj8JGA7sT2P9sGvRFo8ut6twO9lCxhtN6dOkXTthQC2VEY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQdcvUwisculssl2wakSzvIDmsdo0KUCzXKfIaxKboLzg&oe=6B0720AF"}, {"file_name": "Screengrabs_4.png", "id": "507102677251409", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75395590_507102680584742_7420227356861752672_n.png?_nc_cat=111&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=QeYwyIWlqBkQ7kNvwGutkYR&_nc_oc=Adrx-6h6W6NtHIkYSCn-kbCT5XJDcSShcg6XGanRBPf6okhlPZwDGvC09i1l8cwLOco&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQh9ai4SfB9phxi5vUJhUTRTqVH2iYytGec0ktZnc9qmA&oe=6B071FA2"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Curatours", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Visitors can access tours of museums around the world from their desktops, phones or VR headsets. In VR it's an incredibly immersive experience and on other devices it's a bit like a cross between a Zoom Call and playing a game. \n\nYou can choose from three types of tour:\n \nSelf-guided tours can happen at anytime, just login and go exploring!\n \nPre-recorded tours are similar to a self-guided tour only at points a guide will appear to tell you something about that place or the artefact you\u2019re near. It\u2019s a bit like a 3D audio guide.\n \nLive-guided tours put you in a museum or gallery with an expert so you can talk to them and ask questions. To get a live-guided tour you will need to book on to one of the timeslots available. ", "short_description": "Visit art exhibitions and museums with friends and family. Everyone can explore and experience the tours using a either a PC, tablet, smartphone or virtual reality headset."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.coopinnovations.co.uk/privacy/", "developer_terms_of_se